    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Dreamer:</strong> Master Foresayer. When you activate your Stored Foresight spell as a Bonus Action, you can roll 1d4. On a 4, the stored spell is not expended.</p><p><strong>Seeker:</strong> Advanced Disruption. When a spell with a single target affects you or an ally within 10 feet, you may use your Reaction and expend a spell slot equal to or higher than the spell’s level. If you do, the spell fails. Once you use this feature, you cannot do so again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.grimnir.Item.0780716918f8a307]{Dreamer: сохранить заклинание на 4}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.grimnir.Item.d1292c307f567971]{Seeker: Advanced Disruption}</li></ul>"
    },
